      "refersTo": "navigation-active",
      "description": "A subset of the seven ordinary workspace anchors, with current-page state.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Workspaces\"><a href=\"/\" aria-current=\"page\">Operations</a><a href=\"/delivery-lab\">Delivery</a><a href=\"/restaurant-lab\">Restaurants</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;gap:18px;background:var(--ui-bg)}.ds-nav a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;color:var(--ui-muted);text-decoration:none;font:12px/1.5 var(--ui-font)}.ds-nav a:hover{color:var(--ui-ink);border-bottom-color:var(--ui-line)}.ds-nav a[aria-current=page]{color:var(--ui-accent);border-bottom-color:var(--ui-accent);font-weight:500}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ui-accent);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "State chips",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "status-chip-active",
      "description": "Text states; color supplements the label.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-chip\">Idle</span> <span class=\"ds-chip ds-active\">Working</span>",
      "css": ".ds-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;max-width:max-content;border:1px solid var(--ui-line);border-radius:4px;padding:3px 6px;color:var(--ui-muted);font:11px/1.5 var(--ui-font);white-space:nowrap}.ds-active{background:var(--ui-accent-soft);color:var(--ui-accent);border-color:#3a6961}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Shared evidence panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "panel",
      "description": "Shared surface panel used outside Madrid's ground-color operations panels.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><div class=\"ds-panel-title\"><h2>Agents</h2><span>No session loaded</span></div><p class=\"ds-panel-note\">Start a session from Simulation to inspect live agents.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{border:1px solid var(--ui-line);background:var(--ui-surface);border-radius:var(--ui-radius);color:var(--ui-ink);overflow:hidden;font:14px/1.5 var(--ui-font)}.ds-panel-title{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-height:40px;padding:6px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ui-line)}.ds-panel-title h2{margin:0;font-size:15px;font-weight:600}.ds-panel-title span{color:var(--ui-muted);font-size:12px}.ds-panel-note{padding:12px 16px;color:var(--ui-muted);font-size:13px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Shared selected agent row",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "agent-row-selected",
      "description": "Delivery/Restaurant specimen; Madrid uses explicit comparison columns.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-agent\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-identity\"><svg class=\"ds-symbol\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 7 12 3l9 4v11l-9 4-9-4zM3 7l9 4 9-4M12 11v11M7 5l10 4\"/></svg><span><strong>Agent identity</strong><small>Role and current task</small></span></span><span class=\"ds-row-state\">State</span><span class=\"ds-value\">—</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-agent{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 98px 60px;align-items:center;gap:10px;width:100%;min-height:56px;padding:8px 12px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ui-line);border-radius:0;text-align:left;background:var(--ui-accent-soft);color:var(--ui-ink);box-shadow:inset 2px 0 var(--ui-accent);font:400 14px/1.5 var(--ui-font);cursor:pointer}.ds-agent:hover{background:var(--ui-hover)}.ds-agent:active{background:var(--ui-hover)}.ds-agent:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ui-accent);outline-offset:3px}.ds-identity{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;min-width:0}.ds-identity strong{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:500}.ds-identity small{display:block;font-size:11px;color:var(--ui-muted)}.ds-symbol{width:28px;height:28px;flex-shrink:0;color:var(--ui-muted)}.ds-row-state{justify-self:start;font-size:11px;padding:3px 6px;border:1px solid var(--ui-line);border-radius:4px;color:var(--ui-muted)}.ds-value{text-align:right;font:12px var(--ui-mono)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Madrid selected agent row",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "madrid-agent-row-selected",
      "description": "Explicit identity, role, state, task, delivered and rate columns; illustrative placeholders only.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-madrid-row\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-madrid-person\"><svg class=\"ds-madrid-symbol\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"16\" r=\"4\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"16\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"m6 16 5-9 7 9h-7L7 7H4m7 0h4\"/></svg><span><strong>Agent identity</strong><small>Technical ID</small></span></span><span>Role</span><span class=\"ds-madrid-pill\">State</span><span>Current task</span><span class=\"ds-madrid-total\">—</span><span class=\"ds-madrid-rate\">—</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-madrid-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(130px,1.4fr) 54px 94px minmax(88px,1fr) 55px 72px;align-items:center;gap:8px;width:100%;min-height:51px;padding:7px 12px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ui-line);border-radius:0;background:var(--ui-accent-soft);box-shadow:inset 1px 0 var(--ui-accent);color:var(--ui-muted);text-align:left;font:400 11px/1.5 var(--ui-font);cursor:pointer}.ds-madrid-row:hover,.ds-madrid-row:active{background:var(--ui-hover)}.ds-madrid-row:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ui-accent);outline-offset:3px}.ds-madrid-person{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;min-width:0}.ds-madrid-person strong{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:var(--ui-ink)}.ds-madrid-person small{display:block;font-size:10px}.ds-madrid-symbol{width:29px;height:29px;padding:5px;border:1px solid #3b586a;border-radius:50%;background:#193342;color:#c8e2ef;flex-shrink:0}.ds-madrid-pill{justify-self:stretch;justify-content:center;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;border:1px solid #3b5361;border-radius:12px;padding:2px 7px;font-size:10px;line-height:1.35}.ds-madrid-total{text-align:right;font:11px var(--ui-mono)}.ds-madrid-rate{text-align:right;font:10px var(--ui-mono);color:var(--ui-faint)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Madrid map toolbar",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "map-toolbar",
      "description": "Wheel zoom is enabled by default. Escape releases the wheel to page scrolling; Scroll zoom restores it. Preserve selected-agent clearance.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-map-toolbar\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Map controls\"><span>Madrid</span><button>Fit network</button><button>Locate agent</button><button aria-pressed=\"true\">Scroll zoom</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-map-toolbar{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;padding:3px 4px;background:#0c1822;border:1px solid #314957;border-radius:4px;font:11px/1.5 var(--ui-font);color:#c6d7e6}.ds-map-toolbar>span{padding:0 6px;font-weight:500}.ds-map-toolbar button{font:500 10px/1.5 var(--ui-font);min-height:28px;padding:4px 6px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:var(--ui-radius);background:transparent;color:var(--ui-ink);cursor:pointer}.ds-map-toolbar button:hover,.ds-map-toolbar button:active{background:var(--ui-hover);border-color:var(--ui-ink)}.ds-map-toolbar button[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--ui-accent-soft);color:var(--ui-accent)}.ds-map-toolbar button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ui-accent);outline-offset:3px}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Calm, dense operations console",
    "overview": "Dark blue graphite surfaces, cyan selection, restrained state colors, IBM Plex Sans and Mono, fine rules and dense readable rows. The interface follows the user's Linear-style dark operations-console direction: calm, dense, one accent color. Technical reviewers can inspect the same working evidence that operators use.\n\nCompact plain titles keep the working interface near the top. Agents are the protagonist and their shared city stays visible beside them on operational screens; reading and evaluation screens use the same material language without imitating the map layout. Color communicates state, selection or data. The confirmed anti-references are decorative heroes, oversized marketing headlines, split-color or gradient headline text, purple gradients, Inter-everywhere and nested cards.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Local IBM Plex fonts, tabular operational values and explicit technical identifiers.",
      "Flat dark graphite surfaces separated by fine rules; cyan marks actions and selection.",
      "Readable rows, plain labels, visible focus and progressive disclosure of evidence.",
      "Runtime data remains inspectable; missing history and measurements remain explicit."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "One Accent",
        "body": "Cyan identifies primary action, selection and observed activity. Positive, negative, warning and information colors carry operational meaning; they are not alternate brand accents.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "Compact Title",
        "body": "Start with a plain workspace title and the working interface. Do not add a display headline, decorative hero or slogan.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "Flat Surface",
        "body": "Separate working areas with tonal changes and fine rules. Keep ordinary panels and rows shadowless; reserve the small ambient shadow for map overlays.",
        "section": "elevation"
      },
      {
        "name": "Anatomy Type",
        "body": "Use Oxanium only for Agent Anatomy's role and physical-part headings. Keep explanation and controls in Plex Sans and source values in Plex Mono; preserve the shared typography elsewhere.",
        "section": "typography"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do keep simulation setup separate from the operation view where that separation is implemented.",
      "Do preserve distinct entity names, technical IDs and role labels when inspecting agents.",
      "Do use SVG symbols with text labels and state descriptions; color alone must not carry meaning.",
      "Do label the history window, units, simulation clock and session state; render curves only from observed samples.",
      "Do keep unavailable metrics, synthetic fixtures, retained-evidence limits and stale-source caveats visible.",
      "Do keep selected map markers, labels and actual route geometry clear of toolbar and legend controls.",
      "Do retain keyboard focus, reduced-motion behavior, local overflow containers and mobile disclosure controls."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't introduce oversized marketing headlines, split-color headlines, headline gradients or decorative hero sections.",
      "Don't add purple gradients, Inter-everywhere, nested cards or ornamental dashboard effects.",
      "Don't turn an empty history, unknown cost or unknown latency into a fabricated chart or zero.",
      "Don't use a sparse graph overlay as a substitute for Madrid's continuous local basemap.",
      "Don't substitute a role template name for the actual entity identity.",
      "Don't shrink a diagram's detailed reading view merely to force every label into one viewport; provide a whole-diagram overview plus an expanded inspection view."
    ]
  }
}
